Blunt Proficiency represents your training with crushing weapons such as
maces, hammers, clubs, flails, and similar armaments. These weapons rely
on raw impact force rather than cutting edges to damage opponents.

Higher proficiency increases your accuracy and effectiveness with blunt
weapons. As you advance, you learn proper grip, stance, and swing
techniques that allow you to land blows more consistently and with
greater force.

Blunt weapons are particularly effective against armored foes and
skeletons, as crushing force transfers through armor better than slashing
attacks. They are also required for the "smooth" skill, which restores
weapon quality.

Once you have achieved sufficient proficiency in blunt weapons, you may
pursue Blunt Specialization for additional attacks per round.

